ARCHITECTURE / NOTES
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
data flow    : web useChargingSessionDetail (GET /charging/{id}) -> session (primary, gates the page; empty when no session, web !session);
               useChargeTelemetry (GET /charging/{id}/telemetry) -> telemetry; useVehicle (GET /vehicles/{id}) and useChargingTelemetryLatest
               (GET /charging-telemetry/latest?vehicle_id) are scoped to the loaded session's vehicle_id (web session?.vehicle_id), each its own
               lifecycle-aware UiState so no section is hidden. ViewModel keyed by ROUTE_ID:sessionId (route arg, web useParams().id).
SI boundary  : reads SI from API (Phase-42 already stores SI); converts only at the render boundary via ChargingDisplayPrefs (web useUnits/useFormatting):
               energy Wh->kWh (convertEnergyFromSI), power W->kW (convertPowerFromSI), rated_range + live distance fields m->display (convertDistanceFromSI),
               temps C->display (convertTempFromSI). Cost from settings base_cost_per_kwh + currency_symbol. No miles/°F/psi stored or computed.
states       : loading -> PageLoader; error -> ErrorDisplay + Retry; empty -> EmptyState; success -> Body. Each secondary feed renders content-or-empty.
a11y/theme   : charts carry accessibleDescription (web aria-labels: chargeCurve.aria on the curve, socRange.aria on the battery-progress panel via semantics);
               gauges expose a merged contentDescription (RadialGauge); the back glyph is decorative (contentDescription=null). All color via
               MaterialTheme.colorScheme + ChartPalette (TeslaTokens.chart) + TeslaTokens.status (A2 tokens) — dynamic color + dark theme. Typography via the
               role components (PageTitle/PanelTitle/Subhead/BodyText/Caption/HelperText). Compose-native charts (A3 Vico/Canvas wrappers); no webview.
nav          : Destinations 'chargeDetail' -> /charging/:id pre-existing (Destinations.kt L57, count unchanged); host wired via PageHosts.register("chargeDetail");
               deep link auto-registered by TeslaSyncNavHost; the host extracts the {id} arg from the NavBackStackEntry. DataContainer untouched.
units note   : Range-Gained / Miles-Added / Charge-Rate / batteryRange / chargerPowerKw / chargeEnergyAdded reproduce the web's exact display-boundary
               computations + literal unit labels verbatim (parity, including the web's odometer/1000 + legacy *_mi/*_w-as-display quirks).

